window.products.push({"id":1018014,"name":"SONOROUS ST-360 Premium TV Stand for Living Room - Luxury Wood & Glass Media Console with Metal Legs - Modern TV & Media Furniture with Storage - Blac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1189.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GwTqzrJtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝗦𝗧𝗬𝗟𝗜𝗦𝗛 𝗗𝗘𝗦𝗜𝗚𝗡 𝗪𝗜𝗧𝗛 𝗟𝗔𝗦𝗧𝗜𝗡𝗚 𝗔𝗦𝗦𝗨𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗖𝗘: The Sonorous ST-360 television stands feature a contemporary design, combining black glass and high gloss walnut wood to create a sophisticated storage solution for your AV equipment. Manufactured with the highest attention to detail and quality, the ST-360 supports a maximum stand load of 170 lbs and is suitable for screens up to 75\". In addition, for your peace of mind, it comes with a 1-year warranty. 𝗘𝗡𝗛𝗔𝗡𝗖𝗘𝗗 𝗔𝗖𝗖𝗘𝗦𝗦 𝗪𝗜𝗧𝗛 𝗜𝗥 𝗥𝗘𝗣𝗘𝗔𝗧𝗘𝗥 𝗦𝗬𝗦𝗧𝗘𝗠: The Sonorous TV stand for bedroom features IR repeater system that revolutionizes your home entertainment experience by providing seamless control of your AV equipment. The IR repeater system allows to effortlessly manage up to eight devices without having to open doors or settle for less with pass-through glass. The IR repeater system ensures all your devices stay neatly concealed while still remaining fully functional. 𝗘𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗧𝗟𝗘𝗦𝗦 𝗠𝗢𝗕𝗜𝗟𝗜𝗧𝗬 𝗪𝗜𝗧𝗛𝗢𝗨𝗧 𝗗𝗔𝗠𝗔𝗚𝗜𝗡𝗚 𝗙𝗟𝗢𝗢𝗥𝗦: The push-to-open doors of the TV stand are equipped with high-quality hinges, ensuring a seamless and smooth operation. Furthermore, the TV stand is supported by ultra-modern spike metal legs that are fitted with soft plastic end caps, which allow for easy mobility without causing any damage. The design also provides easy rear access for cable management, contributing to an organized entertainment setup. 𝗣𝗥𝗢𝗣𝗘𝗥 𝗩𝗘𝗡𝗧𝗜𝗟𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗙𝗢𝗥 𝗕𝗘𝗧𝗧𝗘𝗥 𝗔𝗜𝗥𝗙𝗟𝗢𝗪: This TV stand is thoughtfully designed with an open rear configuration which promotes enhanced ventilation and prevents overheating of your devices. In addition, the open rear design of the TV Stand also simplifies the process of connecting wires. With easy access to all connecting wires, you can effortlessly maintain a seamless entertainment experience without the hassle of tangled cables. 𝗣𝗥𝗢𝗧𝗘𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗩𝗘 𝗖𝗢𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗡𝗚 𝗙𝗢𝗥 𝗣𝗥𝗜𝗦𝗧𝗜𝗡𝗘 𝗔𝗣𝗣𝗘𝗔𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗖𝗘: Designed for elegance, the glass panels of the stand come with a protective coating that reduces stains and fingerprints. This protection ensures that the glass panels of the TV stand with storage remain in excellent condition, providing a resilient surface for your AV equipment. This makes it easy to maintain the pristine appearance of your entertainment setup while keeping it looking its best at all times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GwTqzrJtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SONOROUS","source_asin":"B07FM7R5W5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FM7R5W5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FM7R5W5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
