window.products.push({"id":1018124,"name":"Home-X Depression Style Blue Glass Salt Cellar with Lid, Retro Kitchen Decor, Wedding Gift - 3 1/2\" H x 4\" D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716YE+P4k8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RETRO FEEL: This glass salt cellar set is reminiscent of another time. The container’s unique style has nostalgic references to the early 1900s. Give this as an eclectic gift or purchase it to spice up your own kitchen with its striking colors, old-fashioned glass, and unique rustic look. Add it to your household accessories today! RUSTIC FARMHOUSE-STYLE DECOR: Although this adorable salt cellar is reminiscent of the same style of glass that was prevalent during the Great Depression, it also adds a country feel to any decor. Put this stylish bowl out during your next holiday party to add some Southern spice. It can even bring a pop of color to your table that is perfect for any holiday. KEEPS SEASONINGS FRESH & DRY: If you are looking for the perfect way to protect your seasonings and spices from moisture in the air, then this useful spice holder is the perfect choice for you. The lid slides easily into place when you have used the desired amount of seasoning, locking in freshness, and keeping moisture out. ADORABLE KITCHEN ACCESSORY: This cute spice saver makes the perfect addition to your home kitchen decorations because of the vintage air it brings to the table. This glass container makes a great housewarming gift for men, women, and couples. Whether you get it for a wedding or as a birthday gift, the recipient is sure to love it. COUNTER DISPLAY: Display this dainty salt container out on your countertop or on the table so all your guests can admire and appreciate it. Although this salt cellar provides a retro, collectible feel, you also have the option of storing it on your spice rack inside the kitchen cabinets as well. Display this Depression-era replica anywhere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716YE+P4k8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B087JXJWJ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087JXJWJ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087JXJWJ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
