window.products.push({"id":1018268,"name":"Hobby Colin Hand Free Portable Personal Fan-Rechargeable Mini USB Neck Fan,3 Level Air Flow - Small Wearable Air Conditioner Neck Fan for Home,Office,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X57ItQqdL._AC_SL1081_.jpg","description":"Instant Cooling:High technology leads new trends. This portable mini air conditioner uses semiconductor cooling technology. The current generated by the semiconductor cooling chip creates a temperature difference and achieves instant cooling within two seconds. It provides you with the cold air you need most and reduces the temperature of your personal space to a maximum of 6 to 9 degrees. Hands-Free & Portable - Soft silicone material with adjustable curved structure provides comfortable neck protection and adjusts size to unused neck circumference. The neck fan is as light and portable as a headset and is hung around the neck. The special handheld design allows you to free your hands and enjoy the cool breeze while doing what you want to do. Hanging on the neck is suitable for traveling in hot weather, which saves you from the embarrassment of dripping sweat in public places. USB Rechargeable & 3 Modes Adjustable -Portable fan has two built-in 1800 mAh lithium polymer batteries, which can be charged for 1.8 hours, the first mode is the breeze mode, the second is the low wind mode, and the third is the high wind mode. Whether you are at work or shopping, you can last 4 or 8 hours (or different speeds). 45 Degree Rotation Design - Our neck cooling fan designed with double fans can breeze and bring you ultra comfort. This neck band air cooler allows you to flexibly adjust the direction of 45 degrees to allow you to find the most appropriate wind direction. Hang cool fans around your neck and take anywhere. Before use: you should tie your hair before using mini personal fans. If the fan cannot reach 3 speeds or can't stop, please recharge the fan. Wide Range of Uses - Mini USB fans are easy to carry and easy to store, and truly hands-free neck band fans. Indoor activities are great outdoors! It is an item which works in every scene such as summer festival, outdoor, BBQ, sports watching, walking, climbing, excursion, festival, commuting, and school. Summer can be used as an electric fan. You can enjoy clean and comfortable air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X57ItQqdL._AC_SL1081_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hobby Colin","source_asin":"B07VPH6ZB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VPH6ZB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VPH6ZB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1018269,"name":"BERYART Kitchen Wall Clock 14 Inch Silent Non Ticking Flower Wall Clocks Quartz Battery Operated Round Clock Easy to Read Wooden Clocks for Living Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iByw0lQkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"BERYART wall clock is a simple design clock, suitable for any room decoration. High-quality Quartz Sweep Movement guarantees accurate time and absolutely silent environment. It is perfect for office, home, indoor, kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom, classroom and school. Attention: 1. Wall clock is operated by 1.5 AA Carbon Zinc or Heavy Duty battery, while the current of alkaline battery is too big and easy to damage the movement and accuracy. 2. Due to the batteries is limited by international transport, the battery is not contained in the package. 3. There are slight difference between the picture and the real wall clock caused by light brightness.  4. The clock is unframed, and there is no glass face as the cover. 5. All our products are strictly inspected, but this problem is unavoidable in the course of transportation.If the hands are curved, you can adjust them directly with your hands to keep them parallel. How to use hook: 1. Please fix the hook on the wall before hanging the clock. 2. Insert one 1.5 AA Carbon Battery and set time. 3. The back slot hangs on the hook. Package includes: 1 x wood wall clock (battery not included) 1 x instruction  1 x hook Due to long-distance transportation, the pointer may be loose. It is recommended to reinstall after getting it. Note: If you have any questions, please contact with us directly.We can solve it in 24 hours, our store is aim at best service for every customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iByw0lQkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BERYART","source_asin":"B08CHG6TGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CHG6TGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CHG6TGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1018270,"name":"Circulon Symmetry Hard Anodized Nonstick Frying Pan / Fry Pan / Hard Anodized Skillet - 11 Inch, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QSzKz5D7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooking healthy and delicious dishes is easier than ever with the versatile Circulon Symmetry Hard-Anodized Nonstick 11-Inch Frying Pan.The induction-compatible Frying Pan's attractive, contemporary exterior adds sophistication and style to any kitchen decor, and the heavy-duty hard-anodized aluminum construction is twice as hard as stainless steel for long-lasting durability. The interior features the TOTAL Nonstick System of raised circles and triple layer, premium quality, metal utensil safe nonstick for long-lasting food release and easy cleanup. In fact, Circulon nonstick technology is so advanced, it lasts 10 times longer than ordinary nonstick. That's why Circulon comes with a Hassle-Free Lifetime Guarantee. A rubberized stainless steel handle offers a comfortable grasp, and the Frying Pan is also oven safe to 400°F. Conveniently dishwasher safe, this Frying Pan makes a perfect addition or beginning for a well-rounded Circulon collection in the kitchen. With hassle-free cleanup and exceptional cooktop performance, this Circulon Symmetry Hard-Anodized Nonstick 11-Inch Frying Pan is perfect for making fast and nutritious dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QSzKz5D7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circulon","source_asin":"B009A1SK0W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009A1SK0W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009A1SK0W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1018271,"name":"Jay Strongwater 20th Anniversary Glass Ornament with Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710PT1wBfwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jay Strongwater 20th Anniversary Glass Ornament with Stand Details From the 20th Anniversary Commemorative Collection. Unique holiday ornament in blown glass. Mouth-blown clear optic-glass ball, with a subtle spiral twist, has been lacquered in transparent ruby hues, hand painted with golden glitter leaves and flowers, and adorned with pave crystal stones. Encircled with 10 thin metal butterflies jeweled in small white pearls. Hangs from a tailor-made ruby-hued stand with a butterfly at the top. Specially painted and dated bottom reads \"Celebrating 20 Years of Fabulousness!\" Ornament, 4.75\"Dia. x 5\"T; with stand, 4.75'W x 6\"D x 8\"T. Made in the USA. Designer About Jay Strongwater: Jay Strongwater's love of the elegant but vividly bejeweled objet—whether it's meant to rest on a tabletop or the graceful curve of a woman's neck—has led him on a journey through the worlds of fashion and home furnishings. He began his career while a student at the Rhode Island School of Design. After garnering raves for a necklace he'd made his mother, he took jewelry samples to open buyer days at some of New York's finest department stores, and soon a burgeoning business was born. At the age of 23, Strongwater met designer Oscar de la Renta, with whom he began to collaborate on jewelry designs for runway shows. The move to home accessories was delightfully serendipitous & organic. For the 1994 holiday season, Strongwater sent gifts of jewel-encrusted filigree picture frames to friends, fashion editors, and buyers, who immediately fell in love with the design. By 1998, his Jewels for the Home collection had supplanted his fashion business. In essence, Strongwater created his own niche: the jeweler turning his meticulous eye and art toward a world beyond a woman's wrists, neck, and ears. Material: Glass, Enamel, Swaorvski Crystals, faux pearl.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710PT1wBfwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jay Strongwater","source_asin":"B015FFRLQA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015FFRLQA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015FFRLQA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
