window.products.push({"id":1018560,"name":"Lily's Home Dad’s Fix-It Shop Sign, Hanging Metal Sign, Garage Decor, Novelty Gifts for Dad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C1njcR9nL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Calling all dads! We’ve got a sign for you that perfectly expresses your love for building and fixing things. This sign is specially designed to be hung up in your workshop. It reads, “Dad’s Fix-It Shop.” Underneath that, it says “Open 24 Hours.” It offers humor and wit while expressing your love for working with your hands. On one side of the sign, it says “Full Service” and on the other side, it reads “Last Stop.” Your kids will get a kick out of it. Plus, it reminds them that they can always turn to you for help. This sign features fun graphics that help establish a warm, inviting ambiance, including wrenches and little stop sign shapes. This sign comes in black and white, making it a versatile piece of decor. Its neutral color scheme will complement a host of interior design themes, so you don’t have to worry about it clashing with your existing decor. This sign is made from metal, so it’s durable and long-lasting. Because it’s metal, you won’t have to worry about it ripping or tearing. It’s sure to last for a long good while. You’ll find holes punched into each corner of the sign, making it easy to hang. Just grab some nails and hammer the sign to the wall. It’s that simple! This sign brings a unique, vintage feel to any home. It’s made to look like an old-fashioned shop sign, complete with chipped paint on the edges. Once you hang it up, it will bring back memories of the good ‘ole days. You could also get this sign as a gift for the special man in your life, whether it’s your dad, grandpa, husband, brother, or uncle. They’ll love your sense of humor as well as this sign’s attractive design. Order it today to revamp your garage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C1njcR9nL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lily's Home","source_asin":"B07RD1G9B1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RD1G9B1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RD1G9B1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
