window.products.push({"id":1018661,"name":"JOMOLA Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink Sponge Tray 2-in-1 Plastic Scrubber Holder with Suction Cup for Kitchen Bathroom Laundry Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w1+bn+5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keeping Clean - The raised bottom of the sink tray keeps your dirty water from flowing backwards, keeping the sink counter dry and not affecting the tidiness of the sink surface. The slightly convex surface of the sponge holder helps preventing standing water and facilitates cleaning. Note:The right angle must be level with the edge of the sink. Versatile Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink - Unlike ordinary dish sponge holders, the sink tray is designed with towel bar. It can be used to store sponges, soap, sink stoppers, scrubbing brushes, dishwashing liquid, hand soap etc. It can also be used to hang small dish towels without taking up too much space in the sink and also facilitates quick air drying of the towels. Perfect Kitchen Sink Organizer - The sink tray only needs to be placed on the surface of the sink, not on the side of the sink, and does not interfere at all with the normal work of the sink, such as washing dishes and bottles. It is perfect for storing loose sponges, soaps and brushes. This simple and stylish design is not limited to your sink area, you can also use this sink tray in your bathroom, laundry room and beauty room. Easy Installation with Suction Cups - The suction cup sponge holder comes with 2 suction cups on the bottom, which can be fixed to the sink countertop by pressing gently before use. Compared to glue and silicone sink caddy container, the suction cup design is stronger, does not move easily, does not leave marks and is perfect for sinks. The suction cups need to be pressed down regularly to achieve maximum suction power. Sizes and Suitable Surfaces - Installation size: 9.06\"/23cm(L)x3.54\"/9cm(W). Please ensure that you install on a smooth, dry and flat surface for the suction cups to attach better. This sink tray is suitable for undermount sink and not for drop-in sink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w1+bn+5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOMOLA","source_asin":"B0BRBGG6BH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRBGG6BH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRBGG6BH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
