window.products.push({"id":1018666,"name":"G.a HOMEFAVOR Multifunctional Enamel Butter Dish Box Butter Keeper Container With Versatile Wooden Lid, Farmhouse Style Enamel Butter Boat for 2 Stick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iNY4Ah1BL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🧀【SUPERIOR MATERIAL】This butter dish is made from durable beech Wood and enamel, which is approved meal prep containers are 100% food safe.And that isanti-rust and never dent.Beside,Our butter box has a beech wooden lid, which is a very hard and tough material. It is also strong, with a close straight grain. Unlike synthetic materials, beech wood will often age gracefully. And with the right maintenance, beech wood can look lovely for many years. 🧀【CUTTING BOARD LID】This butter keeper is designed with a beech wooden lid that you could use lid as a butter cutting board. Beech wooden board is the best when it comes to keeping a razor sharp edge on your favorite knife when preparing butter. So convenient and useful! 🧀【MULTI-FUNCTIONAL DESIGN】This modern butter boat adds a touch of elegance to your kitchen.Beside,the stylish butter dish not only great for butter, but also perfect for cheese, cookies and other essentials of kitchen. The solid beech lid not only keeps the contents safe from disturbance by kitchen pests but also doubles as a serving board or cutting board for slicing. 🧀【EXTRA LARGE CAPACITY】Measurement 6 x 4 x 2.5 inches. No matter what kind of butter you like, this butter containers will satisfy you. 2 sticks of East Coast butter or 1 cube of West Coast/European butter is the best choice. Suitable for most brands’ butter like Kerrygold, Land O'Lakes, Organic Valley etc. 🧀【RISK FREE GUARANTEED】We are confident that this butter bin will meet the expectations of your family. With our expertly crafted food containers, the team takes the hassle out of mealtime!We’re dedicated to creating the highest quality bread holder for family. G.a HOMEFAVOR containers last a lifetime and our customer service team is always here to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iNY4Ah1BL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G.a HOMEFAVOR","source_asin":"B07WD8G452","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WD8G452","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WD8G452","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
