window.products.push({"id":1018883,"name":"vplus Automatic Soap Dispenser, Touchless Soap Dispenser with Waterproof Base Suitable for Bathroom (Stainless Steel)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615xwz9yfeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You don’t need to set up the output of soap liquid. Just remove your hand away from the sensor soap dispenser after using it, and the liquid will stop coming out automatically. No dripping or leaking. SPECIFICATION: Material: Stainless steel PC & ABS plating chrome Capacity: 8oz Package Dimensions: 7.8 x 3.8 x 3.4inches Weight: 13 ounces Sensor Range: 0-6cm/0-2.36in Power Supply: 4 x AAA Alkaline Battery (not included)  Pcking content: 1 x automatic soap dispenser 1 x instruction manual OPERATION: 1. Place batteries in the battery compartment shown in the diagram above.please refer to the batteries section for instruction. 2. Unlock the top cover by turning it anti-clockwise. Gently pull the cover to remove. Fill the compartment with soap. Please make sure that the soap does not contain solid particles in order to avoid clogging. 3. To switch on, press and hold the on/off button for 3 seconds and do the same to switch off. 4. To adjust the volume of soap dispensed, press on/off button once. 5. Repeat step 4 until the desired volume. There are 3 adjustable levels. 6. Place your hand under the sensor(light indicator) to dispense soap. SAFETY INSTRUCTIONS: 1. Please keeps the surface of the stainless steel soap dispenser clean, wipe the body with mop regularly to avoid long-term corrosion upon the unit. 2.Store manual in a safe place for future reference. 3. Do not expose electronics under any circumstances. Do not attempt to repair the bathroom soap dispenser. 4. Do not wash the touchless soap dispenser. Wipe clean with a damp cloth. 5. Avoid direct sunlight to the infrared panel. PACKAGE INCLUDED: 1 x Automatic Soap Dispenser  1 x User Manual 1 x Package Box Tips: the automatic soap dispenser should be installed with the base, or it will be easy to leak. The base is in the package, please do not ignore it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615xwz9yfeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vplus","source_asin":"B085M67R26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1018883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085M67R26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085M67R26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
